<title>ROMANIA: Romania '96 sunflower crop seen at 1.18 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Romania '96 sunflower crop seen at 1.18 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's recently completed 1996 sunflower harvest is seen at around 1.18 million tonnes, some 250,000 tonnes up on last year, the agriculture ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 1996 crop was expected to yield some 250,000 tonnes of sunflower oil, enough to meet local demand and allow exports, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The 1995 sunflowerseed crop totalled around 930,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>--Adrian Dascalu, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
